Sun Oct 25 20:12:20 UTC 2026 - Dirk Müller <dmueller@suse.com>

- update to 7.0.1:
  * Fix hash method on Role and DelegatedRole
  * Fix incorrect dependency range for urllib3
  * ngclient: Fix connection exception handling
  * ngclient: Fix incorrect delegation in diamond-shape case
  * ngclient: Avoid use of symlink on Windows: it requires
    privileges

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Tue May 19 22:15:53 UTC 2026 - Dirk Müller <dmueller@suse.com>

- update to 7.0.0:
  * This is a major release only because of a minor ngclient API
    tweak: there are no large functional changes.
  * Fix GHSA-qp9x-wp8f-qgjj:
  * Incorrect delegation path matching on Windows
  * Various documentation fixes
  * ngclient: `Updater()` now requires the named bootstrap
    argument to make it clearer that providing one is strongly
    recommended: previous default functionality can be reproduced
    with `bootstrap=None`
  * Prepare for removal of securesystemslib.hash

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Wed Apr 16 01:34:01 UTC 2025 - Steve Kowalik <steven.kowalik@suse.com>

- Update to 6.0:
  * ngclient: urllib3 is used as the HTTP library by default instead of
    requests.
  * ngclient: TLS certificate source was changed. Certificates now come from
    operating system certificate store instead of certifi.
  * ngclient: The updater can now initialize from embedded initial root
    metadata every time.
  * Test infrastructure has improved and should now be more usable externally.
- Remove duplicate BuildRequires on fdupes.

